The 6 master files are too large for git; they are assets of release `masters-v1` in world/curator, named `<film id>.<ext>` (see MANIFEST.tsv, with SHA-256 and size).
Reproduce: `corpus/fetch_verify.sh DIR` downloads each from its original URL (corpus/masters.tsv) and checks size and SHA-256; it was run and passed 6/6 (corpus/verify_results.tsv).
